# Group-Based Multi-Project Authentication API Test Suite
# 
# This file contains HTTP requests to test the group-based authentication system.
# All endpoints follow clean RESTful conventions without confusing naming.
#
# Architecture: Users → User Groups → Project Access → Project Groups → Permissions

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@username = testuser
@password = testpass123
@email = test@example.com
@projectHash = test_project_hash

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/ping

### System Information
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/info

### Test User Registration
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username={{username}}&password={{password}}&email={{email}}&project_hash={{projectHash}}

### Test User Login (Save the session token from response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username={{username}}&password={{password}}&project_hash={{projectHash}}

### Variables for authenticated requests (replace with actual token)
@sessionToken = your_session_token_here

### Validate Session
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### Get User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### Get User Access Summary (Groups and Projects)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/access-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### Create New Project
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

project_name=Test Project&project_description=A test project for the group-based system

### List User's Accessible Projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### Search Projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/?search=test&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### Get Project Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectHash}}
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### Get Project Groups
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectHash}}/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### 
### Group-Based System Testing Scenarios
###

### Scenario 1: Admin User Workflow
# 1. Register as admin user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=admin123&email=admin@example.com&project_hash={{projectHash}}

# 2. Login as admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=admin123&project_hash={{projectHash}}

# 3. Create project (admin permission required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

project_name=Admin Created Project&project_description=Project created by admin user

### Scenario 2: Regular User Workflow  
# 1. Register as regular user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=regularuser&password=userpass123&email=user@example.com&project_hash={{projectHash}}

# 2. Login as regular user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=regularuser&password=userpass123&project_hash={{projectHash}}

# 3. View accessible projects only
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

# 4. Check access to specific project
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectHash}}
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### Scenario 3: Group Access Testing
# Test that users can only see projects their groups have access to

# 1. Try to access project without permission (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/unauthorized_project_hash
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

# 2. View user's group memberships
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/access-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### Error Handling Tests

### Test invalid login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=invalid&password=invalid&project_hash=invalid

### Test duplicate registration
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username={{username}}&password={{password}}&email={{email}}&project_hash={{projectHash}}

### Test invalid session token
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/validate
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here

### Test unauthorized project access
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/unauthorized_project
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

